        "quiz_id": 3388,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Nowadays, a growing number of people with health problems are trying alternative medicines and treatments instead of visiting their usual doctor. Do you think this is a positive or a negative development?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVptdFNAloksP8xl8DglpZeugQd\"><strong><em>Nowadays, a growing number of people with health problems are trying alternative medicines and treatments instead of visiting their usual doctor. Do you think this is a positive or a negative development?</em></strong></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Alternative Medicine&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RpfhdE80joSJx1xCwhElQ3wZgRd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Alternative Medicine&nbsp;cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Nhiều người đang t&igrave;m tới việc trị liệu qua y học thay thế thay v&igrave; kh&aacute;m b&aacute;c sĩ truyền thống</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bw15dw7SUoaYFVxmQUClgK9ygAc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Bạn thấy việc n&agrave;y t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MZ7OdCJ6FoGlcdxalBfl1VqngHb\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Alternative Medicine&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LwMFd2C5QoNylRxAcXslKn74gwe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fc78dbRYxoV26CxaUbRlTxlegMg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RaT6dFadhoBcPixiKOqlBdStgwg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GaLcdRHZVoXkqZxoa4RlHARCgDb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VNHYdFew7oTOB9xQ5XglwsgWgOg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>consult<em> (kham vấn)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L02bdjIjboGN5ZxwapglXgzDgdh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>conventional doctors <em>(b&aacute;c sĩ truyền thống)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpxwdhOIIox4jcxXwoblPhJ4g3b\">Bạn n&ecirc;n n&oacute;i r&otilde; quan điểm của m&igrave;nh l&agrave; thấy việc n&agrave;y t&iacute;ch cực, hoặc kh&ocirc;ng t&iacute;ch cực. Ở đ&acirc;y, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm l&agrave; <strong>'kh&ocirc;ng</strong> <strong>t&iacute;ch cực'</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>n&oacute; kh&ocirc;ng đ&aacute;ng tin cậy như b&aacute;c sĩ truyền thống.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RXmmdOQ7ZoYtOAxEj2ElOOZJgAh\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VsX0d17c3oymISxA7qnl4rb0gpK\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXiadZyfHo8Np9x5RWtl0lhlgxb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về một số c&aacute;i lợi nhỏ m&agrave; y học thay thế đem lại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TDZHdpRV9ob54PxDSpnluPN7gKc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng y học thay thế c&oacute; nhiều c&aacute;i hại đ&aacute;ng kể đến sức khỏe người bệnh.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TvMtdD8EOoUnB4x0Lyrl83nwgLb\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RW9vdi5DgoGMxuxOjTulxLyagEd\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D84ndhUkdo6YdMxsaKYl5MIygYb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gj9Yd4ibZoAqqJxECXjlMqnugjc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYhSdCBYDoUZIHxucBYlYczmg4g\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong><strong>B&agrave;n về một số c&aacute;i lợi nhỏ m&agrave; y học thay thế đem lại</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UxbkdsyaqojMVRxTaPDlm6mcgBd\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UxbkdsyaqojMVRxTaPDlm6mcgBd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:&nbsp;</strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, y học thay thế c&oacute; điểm hấp dẫn ri&ecirc;ng.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Afz2ddvUwop7saxh1pOlj5XugZg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Afz2ddvUwop7saxh1pOlj5XugZg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U24ldAPzooo3hFxBwMJlBSEcgyd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Được l&agrave;m từ <em>nguy&ecirc;n liệu tự nhi&ecirc;n (derived from natural ingredients) </em>v&agrave; c&oacute; &iacute;t <em>t&aacute;c dụng phụ (side effects)</em> hơn.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SIy7daDcyow51dxq0y1liXtAgye\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>Nhiều người d&ugrave;ng <em>tr&agrave; thảo mộc (herbal tea)</em> để cải thiện giấc ngủ thay v&igrave; uống thuốc ngủ.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VUOOdU4mQoVNX5xNXxLlilC3gUd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SUbUde3ipowTY1x4EfDlmniVgyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Tiết kiệm chi ph&iacute; (cost-effective) hơn thuốc hay<em> thủ tục y khoa th&ocirc;ng thường (conventional medical procedures)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jj2JdfpqIo5yw4xHIUTln68Xgge\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Những gia đ&igrave;nh thu nhập thấp c&oacute; thể sử dụng dễ d&agrave;ng hơn thay v&igrave; <em>chật vật để chi trả viện ph&iacute; (struggle to afford standard hospital treatments).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong><strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng y học thay thế c&aacute;i nhiều c&aacute;i hại đ&aacute;ng kể đến sức khỏe người bệnh</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BS7odHCD9ouJIMx1PqKlnHpegYf\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BS7odHCD9ouJIMx1PqKlnHpegYf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:&nbsp;</strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng c&aacute;i hại của y học thay thế đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NATnduz1ooqunWxGqnxlqZeVgqg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NATnduz1ooqunWxGqnxlqZeVgqg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTIFdmSa6oiUtzxieG0l0maFg3b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Thiếu <em>dẫn chứng khoa học (scientific evidence)</em> cho những phương ph&aacute;p điều trị thay thế.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TAeydEcQPoiHvlxdj76lw3yQgGf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact: </strong>Thuốc th&ocirc;ng thường phải được <em>thử v&agrave; kiểm định kỹ (undergo rigorous clinical trials)</em>, trong khi y học thay thế<em> kh&ocirc;ng được kiểm tra kỹ (lack propoer testing)</em>, dẫn đến nguy hiểm đến sức khỏe người bệnh.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IyKWdXl4Jo7guzxYpKqlXAGQgQg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ISPkd6CBXoxCkFx5l6QljJOogih\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Thiếu <em>quy tr&igrave;nh v&agrave; luật chuẩn h&oacute;a (standardized regulations)</em> cho y học thay thế.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BY2mdXDACoDPdoxhdkZlrw0tgdf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; <em>ti&ecirc;u chuẩn nhất định (universal standards)</em>, do đ&oacute; ai cũng c&oacute; thể tự cho rằng m&igrave;nh l&agrave; chuy&ecirc;n gia m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng cần <em>bằng cấp r&otilde; r&agrave;ng (proper qualifications).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt lại ngắn gọn c&aacute;c &yacute; đ&atilde; được thảo luận trong 2 đoạn BODY nh&eacute;.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VfQ3d5yCDoJva6xFyAmlDvTug7D\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QJ9KdsTCBo7ht2x0wacl8McWgMh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">scientific backing <em>(dẫn chứng khoa học)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 784,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BCG8dq88kox7CRxcg5blHki9gSh\">In recent years, there has been a growing tendency for people with health issues to seek alternative treatments instead of consulting conventional doctors. While this trend may offer some advantages, I believe it is largely a negative development.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14119,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 785,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVsCdvtVAoOwnZx5aTolD9eegrf\">Admittedly, alternative medicine has certain appealing characteristics. <span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">One notable benefit is that these treatments are derived from natural ingredients, such as herbal remedies and traditional medicines, which typically carry fewer side effects compared to pharmaceutical drugs. For instance, many people prefer using herbal tea to improve their sleep quality rather than relying on sleeping pills.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, alternative treatments tend to be more cost-effective than conventional medical procedures since they do not require expensive equipment or facilities. This makes them more accessible to low-income families who might struggle to afford standard hospital treatments like surgery or specialized therapy.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14119,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 786,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
